# A face's row on a shell's screen hovers and selects the face on the
# model: the extrusion of path_extrude hollowed open at its top, as in
# ext_shell; the mouse over the face's row hovers the top face, and a
# click selects it, on the solid before the shell.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Shell Solid
tw
twmove 96 165
dump
twdown L 96 165
twup L 96 165
dump
tw
